  <div class="markdown summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.UI.Screens.SaveFileListPopup.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="4">Base class for popups that display and manage save file lists
Provides common functionality for save file display, selection, and deletion
Derived classes implement specific load/save behaviors</p>
</div>
  <div class="markdown conceptual"></div>

